{"candidateAnswer":"His loved ones and staying active outdoors","evidence":"[D5:9 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: Thanks Sam! My family motivates me to stay healthy. Well, it helps a lot with my health goals. It tracks my progress really well and serves as a constant reminder to keep going.\n[D5:11 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: It's been awesome, Sam! That visual reminder has been really motivating.\n[D5:13 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: I'm motivated by a thirst for adventure on interesting hikes, that's pretty cool!","itemId":"urn:uuid:b64e91ae-1924-5706-acf0-ff56708cfe80","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ea5f2e2e5be564fb1ca7718cfd4f46b6a1da1825da997aedfdbfcbe92f34e69e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What motivates Evan to take care of his health?","referenceAnswer":"family, fitness tracker, thirst for adventure on interesting hikes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ea5f2e2e5be564fb1ca7718cfd4f46b6a1da1825da997aedfdbfcbe92f34e69e"}}]}